.TH AVR\-VARIABLE\-LIST 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-variable-list \- List names, scoped-value counts, and update times.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr variable list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List names, scoped-value counts, and update times.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-jq\fR, \fB\-q\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter JSON with an embedded jq expression.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output comma-separated fields, * for all, or ? to list fields.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug; does not broaden availability.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR, \fB\-R\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository full name or ID; defaults to the current checkout.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-variable (1),
.BR avr-variable-delete (1),
.BR avr-variable-edit (1),
.BR avr-variable-get (1),
.BR avr-variable-set (1)
